*.zip
deutsch-users*.csv
*.bak
*.tmp
scratch/

# ---------- SHOW (pushed to GitHub) ----------
# Everything else: index.html, css/, js/, firestore.rules, README.md, .nojekyll.
# js/firebase-config.js IS meant to be public (Firebase web keys are not secrets;
# your Firestore rules protect the data), so it stays tracked.